# Kandelo patch rationale (S37)
#
# Node's CommonJS retry decision needs facts from the actual failed parse,
# including token kind, escapes and declaration identity. Stock reports lose
# some of them. Keep owned/copy-safe facts and put Node classification and
# wording in the bridge. The unused callSyntaxAllowed field was removed;
# its consumed information already exists in the report origin. Do not
# replace structured facts with rescanning or English-message matching.
#
# Source-only cleanup; not rebuilt or behavior-qualified. Retention remains
# subject to README.md: Future work: platform omissions.

